msgstr "N"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Fixed sample size at which the probability of conclusive, misleading, and "
"inconclusive evidence is evaluated."
msgstr ""
"決定的な証拠・誤った方向の証拠・決定的でない証拠の確率を評価する、固定のサン"
"プルサイズです。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Allocation ratio (N₂/N₁):"
msgstr "割り付け比 (N₂/N₁):"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Ratio of the sample size in group 2 to the sample size in group 1."
msgstr "第2群と第1群のサンプルサイズの比です。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Design Results"
msgstr "デザインの結果"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Design summary"
msgstr "デザインの要約"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the main fixed-design result: the required sample size or the achieved "
"probability of conclusive evidence."
msgstr ""
"固定デザインの主な結果、すなわち必要なサンプルサイズ、または達成された決定的"
"な証拠の確率を表示します。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Decision probabilities"
msgstr "判定の確率"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show probabilities of evidence for H₁, evidence for H₀, and inconclusive "
"evidence under each design prior."
msgstr ""
"各デザイン事前分布のもとでの、H₁ の証拠・H₀ の証拠・決定的でない証拠の確率を"
"表示します。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Design specification"
msgstr "デザインの指定"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the analysis and design priors used for computing and evaluating the "
"Bayes factor design."
msgstr ""
"ベイズファクターデザインの計算と評価に使う、分析事前分布とデザイン事前分布を"
"表示します。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "プロット"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Decision Probability"
msgstr "判定の確率"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Decision probabilities by effect size"
msgstr "効果量ごとの判定の確率"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Plot how conclusive, misleading, and inconclusive evidence probabilities "
"change across design-prior effect sizes."
msgstr ""
"デザイン事前分布の効果量にわたって、決定的な証拠・誤った方向の証拠・決定的で"
"ない証拠の確率がどう変わるかをプロットします。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Decision probabilities by sample size"
msgstr "サンプルサイズごとの判定の確率"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Plot how conclusive, misleading, and inconclusive evidence probabilities "
"change as the fixed sample size increases."
msgstr ""
"固定のサンプルサイズが増えるにつれて、決定的な証拠・誤った方向の証拠・決定的"
"でない証拠の確率がどう変わるかをプロットします。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Log sample-size axis"
msgstr "サンプルサイズ軸を対数にする"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Use a logarithmic x-axis to inspect changes across small and large sample "
"sizes."
msgstr ""
"x軸を対数にして、小さいサンプルサイズと大きいサンプルサイズにわたる変化を調べ"
"ます。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid "Combine H₁ and H₀"
msgstr "H₁ と H₀ をまとめる"

msgctxt "BayesFactorDesign|"
msgid ""
"Display curves for the H₁ and H₀ design priors in one figure instead of "
"separate figures."
msgstr ""
"H₁ と H₀ のデザイン事前分布の曲線を、別々の図ではなく1つの図に表示します。"

