msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the main sequential-design result: the maximum sample size or the "
"achieved probability of conclusive evidence."
msgstr ""
"逐次デザインの主な結果、すなわち最大サンプルサイズ、または達成された決定的な"
