msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Sample size summary"
msgstr "サンプルサイズの要約"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the expected sample size and its variability under each design prior."
msgstr ""
"各デザイン事前分布のもとでの期待サンプルサイズと、そのばらつきを表示します。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Decision probabilities"
msgstr "判定の確率"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show final probabilities of evidence for H₁, evidence for H₀, and "
"inconclusive evidence under each design prior."
msgstr ""
"各デザイン事前分布のもとでの、H₁ の証拠・H₀ の証拠・決定的でない証拠の最終的"
"な確率を表示します。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Design specification"
msgstr "デザインの指定"

