msgid ""
"Show the analysis and design priors used for computing and evaluating the "
"Bayes factor sequential design."
msgstr ""
"ベイズファクター逐次デザインの計算と評価に使う、分析事前分布とデザイン事前分"
"布を表示します。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Look-by-Look Results"
msgstr "中間解析ごとの結果"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Cumulative decision probabilities"
msgstr "累積の判定確率"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the probability that the study has stopped for each decision by each "
"planned look."
msgstr ""
"計画された各中間解析までに、それぞれの判定で試験が中止された確率を表示しま"
"す。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Incremental decision probabilities"
msgstr "増分の判定確率"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the probability that each decision is first reached at a given look."
msgstr "それぞれの判定に、ある中間解析ではじめて到達する確率を表示します。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Stopping boundaries"
msgstr "中止境界"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Show the test-statistic values corresponding to the Bayes factor stopping "
"thresholds at each look."
msgstr ""
"各中間解析でのベイズファクターの中止しきい値に対応する、検定統計量の値を表示"
"します。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "プロット"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Decision Probability"
msgstr "判定の確率"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Plot how stopping probabilities for conclusive, misleading, and inconclusive "
"evidence accumulate across looks."
msgstr ""
"決定的な証拠・誤った方向の証拠・決定的でない証拠それぞれについて、中間解析に"
"わたって中止の確率がどう蓄積するかをプロットします。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
"Plot the test-statistic boundaries that trigger stopping for H₁ or H₀ at "
"each look."
msgstr ""
"各中間解析で H₁ または H₀ の中止を引き起こす検定統計量の境界をプロットしま"
"す。"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid "Combine H₁ and H₀"
msgstr "H₁ と H₀ をまとめる"

msgctxt "BayesFactorSequentialDesign|"
msgid ""
