"probability 0.5, the default difference 0.1 implies p2 = 0.4."
msgstr ""
"対立仮説のリスク差 p1 - p2 です。既定のベースラインイベント確率 0.5 のもとで"
"は、既定の差 0.1 は p2 = 0.4 を意味します。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Alternative risk ratio p1 / p2. The default example effect is 1.3."
msgstr "対立仮説のリスク比 p1 / p2 です。既定の例では効果は 1.3 です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Alternative odds ratio comparing p1 to p2. The default example effect is 1.3."
msgstr "p1 と p2 を比べる対立仮説のオッズ比です。既定の例では効果は 1.3 です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Alternative effect used to derive the second event probability."
msgstr "2つ目のイベント確率を導くのに使う対立仮説の効果です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Scale used for the binary fixed-design sample-size calculation and null "
"margin. The event probabilities are entered directly."
msgstr ""
"二値エンドポイントの固定デザインのサンプルサイズ計算と帰無マージンに使うス"
"ケールです。イベント確率は直接入力します。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Scale used to derive the second event probability and to set the binary "
"fixed-design sample-size calculation."
msgstr ""
"2つ目のイベント確率を導き、二値エンドポイントの固定デザインのサンプルサイズ計"
"算を設定するのに使うスケールです。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Canonical effect:"
msgstr "正準効果:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Standardized mean difference:"
msgstr "標準化平均差:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Effect magnitude:"
msgstr "効果の大きさ:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "δ"
msgstr "δ"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "SMD"
msgstr "SMD"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Canonical information-scale effect. This is not necessarily Cohen's d."
msgstr "情報スケール上の正準効果です。必ずしもコーエンのdではありません。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Standardized mean difference for a one-sample design, or mean paired "
"difference divided by the SD of paired differences for a paired design."
msgstr ""
"1標本デザインの標準化平均差、または対応のあるデザインでは、対応する差の平均を"
"その差の標準偏差で割ったものです。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Standardized mean difference for two independent groups. The design uses "
"total sample size as information and adjusts for the allocation ratio."
msgstr ""
"独立した2群の標準化平均差です。このデザインは全体のサンプルサイズを情報として"
"使い、割り付け比を調整します。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Effect magnitude used to compute the information-scale δ."
msgstr "情報スケールの δ を計算するのに使う効果の大きさです。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Error Rates"
msgstr "誤りの確率"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Type I error rate:"
msgstr "第1種の誤りの確率:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "α"
msgstr "α"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"One-sided upper-bound Type I error rate. For symmetric two-sided designs, "
"the total Type I error rate is 2α."
msgstr ""
"片側の上側境界における第1種の誤りの確率です。両側対称デザインでは、全体の第1"
"種の誤りの確率は 2α になります。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Target power:"
msgstr "目標とする検出力:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "1 - β"
msgstr "1 - β"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Target power under the alternative hypothesis. gsDesign uses β = 1 - power "
"and adjusts the maximum information to achieve this power; for asymmetric β-"
"spending designs, β is also the total lower-bound spending under the "
"alternative."
msgstr ""
"対立仮説のもとで目標とする検出力です。gsDesign は β = 1 - 検出力 を使い、この"
"検出力を達成するように最大情報量を調整します。非対称 β消費デザインでは、β は"
"対立仮説のもとでの下側境界の消費の合計でもあります。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Information and Sample Size Scale"
msgstr "情報とサンプルサイズのスケール"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Design scaling method:"
msgstr "デザインのスケーリング方法:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Information ratio"
msgstr "情報比"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Fixed design value"
msgstr "固定デザインの値"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Information-scale effect (δ)"
msgstr "情報スケールの効果 (δ)"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Controls whether the design is scaled by relative information, a fixed-"
"design value, or an effect-specific sample-size calculation."
msgstr ""
"デザインを、相対情報量・固定デザインの値・効果に応じたサンプルサイズ計算のい"
"ずれでスケーリングするかを決めます。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Fixed design value:"
msgstr "固定デザインの値:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "N, info, or events"
msgstr "N・情報量・イベント数"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Fixed-design value with no interim analyses. For simple sample-size designs "
"this is N; for information-based or event-driven designs, enter information "
"units or events."
msgstr ""
"中間解析を行わない固定デザインの値です。単純なサンプルサイズのデザインでは N "
"を、情報量にもとづくデザインやイベント数で決まるデザインでは情報量またはイベ"
"ント数を入力します。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Effect scale:"
msgstr "効果のスケール:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Scale used to convert the planned effect to the information scale. Endpoint-"
"specific binary and survival choices first compute fixed-design sample size "
"or events."
msgstr ""
"計画した効果を情報スケールに変換するのに使うスケールです。二値エンドポイント"
"や生存時間の選択肢では、まず固定デザインのサンプルサイズまたはイベント数を計"
"算します。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Canonical effect (δ)"
msgstr "正準効果 (δ)"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Standardized mean difference (one sample / paired)"
msgstr "標準化平均差 (1標本・対応あり)"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Standardized mean difference (independent samples)"
msgstr "標準化平均差 (対応なし)"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Mean difference (one sample / paired)"
msgstr "平均差 (1標本・対応あり)"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Mean difference (independent samples)"
msgstr "平均差 (対応なし)"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Two-sample binary endpoint"
msgstr "2標本の二値エンドポイント"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Survival hazard ratio"
msgstr "生存時間のハザード比"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Mean difference:"
msgstr "平均差:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Δ"
msgstr "Δ"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Absolute effect on the natural scale. Direction is ignored for information "
"planning."
msgstr "もとの尺度での効果の絶対値です。情報量の計画では向きは無視されます。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Common standard deviation:"
msgstr "共通の標準偏差:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Outcome / difference SD:"
msgstr "アウトカム・差の標準偏差:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "SD"
msgstr "SD"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"For one-sample designs, use the outcome SD; for paired designs, use the SD "
"of paired differences; for independent samples, use the common outcome SD."
msgstr ""
"1標本デザインではアウトカムの標準偏差を、対応のあるデザインでは対応する差の標"
"準偏差を、対応のないデザインでは共通のアウトカムの標準偏差を使います。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Allocation ratio:"
msgstr "割り付け比:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "N₂/N₁"
msgstr "N₂/N₁"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Ratio of group 2 to group 1 sample size. For survival endpoints, treat group "
"2 as experimental and group 1 as control."
msgstr ""
"第2群と第1群のサンプルサイズの比です。生存時間エンドポイントでは、第2群を実験"
"群、第1群を対照群として扱います。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Binary endpoint input:"
msgstr "二値エンドポイントの入力方法:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Choose whether to enter both event probabilities directly or enter a "
"baseline event probability and an alternative effect."
msgstr ""
"2つのイベント確率を直接入力するか、ベースラインのイベント確率と対立仮説の効果"
"を入力するかを選びます。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Baseline event probability + effect"
msgstr "ベースラインのイベント確率 + 効果"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Event probabilities (p₁, p₂)"
msgstr "イベント確率 (p₁, p₂)"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Event probability group 1:"
msgstr "第1群のイベント確率:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "p₁"
msgstr "p₁"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Event probability in group 1 under the alternative hypothesis."
msgstr "対立仮説のもとでの第1群のイベント確率です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Event probability group 2:"
msgstr "第2群のイベント確率:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "p₂"
msgstr "p₂"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Event probability in group 2 under the alternative hypothesis."
msgstr "対立仮説のもとでの第2群のイベント確率です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Baseline event probability:"
msgstr "ベースラインのイベント確率:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Event probability for group 1 under the alternative hypothesis. A value near "
"0.5 is conservative for risk-difference planning because it gives the "
"largest Bernoulli variance."
msgstr ""
"対立仮説のもとでの第1群のイベント確率です。0.5 に近い値はベルヌーイ分散が最大"
"になるため、リスク差にもとづく計画では保守的です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Binary effect scale:"
msgstr "二値エンドポイントの効果スケール:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Risk difference"
msgstr "リスク差"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Risk ratio"
msgstr "リスク比"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Odds ratio"
msgstr "オッズ比"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Null risk difference:"
msgstr "帰無仮説のリスク差:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Null risk difference p1 - p2. Use 0 for equal event probabilities."
msgstr ""
"帰無仮説のリスク差 p1 - p2 です。イベント確率が等しい場合は 0 を使います。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Null risk ratio:"
msgstr "帰無仮説のリスク比:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "RR₀"
msgstr "RR₀"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Null risk ratio p1 / p2. Use 1 for equal event probabilities."
msgstr ""
"帰無仮説のリスク比 p1 / p2 です。イベント確率が等しい場合は 1 を使います。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Null odds ratio:"
msgstr "帰無仮説のオッズ比:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "OR₀"
msgstr "OR₀"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Null odds ratio. Use 1 for equal event probabilities."
msgstr "帰無仮説のオッズ比です。イベント確率が等しい場合は 1 を使います。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Alternative hazard ratio:"
msgstr "対立仮説のハザード比:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "HR"
msgstr "HR"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Experimental/control hazard ratio under the alternative hypothesis. The "
"default example effect is 1.3."
msgstr ""
"対立仮説のもとでの実験群と対照群のハザード比です。既定の例では効果は 1.3 で"
"す。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Null hazard ratio:"
msgstr "帰無仮説のハザード比:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "HR₀"
msgstr "HR₀"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"The subjects + events survival calculation supports only HR0 = 1. Use events "
"only or group sequential accrual for a non-null hazard-ratio margin."
msgstr ""
"被験者 + イベント数による生存時間の計算は HR0 = 1 にしか対応していません。帰"
"無仮説のハザード比が 1 でない場合は、イベント数のみ、または群逐次の登録を使っ"
"てください。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Hazard ratio specified by the null hypothesis."
msgstr "帰無仮説で指定されるハザード比です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Survival information method:"
msgstr "生存時間の情報量の求め方:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Selects whether survival information is planned as events only, as fixed-"
"design subjects plus events, or directly as a group sequential survival "
"design with study-time accrual assumptions."
msgstr ""
"生存時間の情報量を、イベント数のみで計画するか、固定デザインの被験者数とイベ"
"ント数で計画するか、試験時間の登録の仮定を含む群逐次生存時間デザインとして直"
"接計画するかを選びます。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Events only"
msgstr "イベント数のみ"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Subjects + events"
msgstr "被験者 + イベント数"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Group sequential accrual"
msgstr "群逐次の登録"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Control hazard:"
msgstr "対照群のハザード:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "λC"
msgstr "λC"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Control-group event hazard per time unit. Use the same time unit as accrual, "
"study duration, follow-up, and dropout hazards. Defaults to 0.0833 for "
"subjects + events and 0.1155 for group sequential accrual."
msgstr ""
"単位時間あたりの対照群のイベントハザードです。登録・試験期間・追跡・脱落のハ"
"ザードと同じ時間単位を使ってください。既定は被験者 + イベント数では 0.0833、"
"群逐次の登録では 0.1155 です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Dropout hazard:"
msgstr "脱落ハザード:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "η"
msgstr "η"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Equal dropout hazard for both groups, per time unit. Use 0 for no dropout."
msgstr ""
"両群に共通の、単位時間あたりの脱落ハザードです。脱落がない場合は 0 を使いま"
"す。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Accrual duration:"
msgstr "登録期間:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Tr"
msgstr "Tr"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "R"
msgstr "R"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Enrollment duration in the same time unit as the survival hazards and study "
"duration."
msgstr "生存時間のハザードや試験期間と同じ時間単位での組み入れ期間です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Study duration:"
msgstr "試験期間:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Ts"
msgstr "Ts"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "T"
msgstr "T"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Maximum study duration. Use the same time unit as the control hazard and "
"accrual duration. Defaults to 24 for subjects + events and 18 for group "
"sequential accrual."
msgstr ""
"試験期間の最大値です。対照群のハザードや登録期間と同じ時間単位を使ってくださ"
"い。既定は被験者 + イベント数では 24、群逐次の登録では 18 です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Entry distribution:"
msgstr "組み入れの分布:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "entry"
msgstr "組み入れ"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Patient entry distribution during the enrollment period."
msgstr "組み入れ期間中の患者の組み入れ分布です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Uniform"
msgstr "一様"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Exponential"
msgstr "指数"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Entry rate parameter:"
msgstr "組み入れ率のパラメータ:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "γ"
msgstr "γ"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Non-zero γ for exponential entry; positive values are convex and negative "
"values are concave. The default is a non-zero starting value."
msgstr ""
"指数型の組み入れに使う 0 でない γ です。正の値は凸型、負の値は凹型になりま"
"す。既定は 0 でない開始値です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Accrual-rate pattern:"
msgstr "登録率のパターン:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Enrollment-rate pattern. With fixed study duration and minimum follow-up, "
"the calculation rescales this value to the required accrual rate; the "
"default scalar 1 gives constant accrual."
msgstr ""
"組み入れ率のパターンです。試験期間と最小追跡期間を固定すると、計算はこの値を"
"必要な登録率に再スケールします。既定のスカラー 1 は一定の登録を表します。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Minimum follow-up:"
msgstr "最小追跡期間:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "minfup"
msgstr "minfup"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Minimum follow-up duration in the same time unit as the study duration."
msgstr "試験期間と同じ時間単位での最小の追跡期間です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Accrual calculation method:"
msgstr "登録の計算方法:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Method used for the fixed-design survival calculation inside the group "
"sequential accrual design."
msgstr ""
"群逐次の登録デザインの内部で、固定デザインの生存時間の計算に使う方法です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Lachin-Foulkes"
msgstr "Lachin-Foulkes"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Schoenfeld"
msgstr "Schoenfeld"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Freedman"
msgstr "Freedman"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Bernstein-Lagakos"
msgstr "Bernstein-Lagakos"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Look Schedule"
msgstr "中間解析の予定"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Number of looks:"
msgstr "中間解析の回数:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Number of planned analyses, including the final analysis."
msgstr "最終解析を含む、計画された解析の回数です。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Look schedule:"
msgstr "中間解析の予定:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Equally spaced information"
msgstr "情報量を等間隔にする"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Custom information fractions"
msgstr "情報割合を指定する"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Controls the relative timing of interim analyses on the planned information "
"scale; this is information time, not calendar time."
msgstr ""
"計画された情報スケール上での中間解析の相対的な時期を決めます。これは情報時間"
"であり、暦時間ではありません。"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid "Information fractions:"
msgstr "情報割合:"

msgctxt "GroupSequentialParameterControls|"
msgid ""
"Increasing information fractions. Supply K values ending in 1, or K - 1 "
"interim values strictly below 1. The default schedule is generated from K."
msgstr ""
"増加する情報割合です。末尾が 1 の K 個の値か、1 より小さい K - 1 個の中間値を"
"指定します。既定の予定は K から生成されます。"
